Equation of tangent at \(C\):

\[
y - 0 = m_{tC} (x - 9) \implies y = \frac{4.5}{k} (x-9).
\]

---

### Step 7: Find intersection point \(D\)

Solve system:

\[
\begin{cases}
y = -\frac{4.5}{k} x \\
y = \frac{4.5}{k} (x - 9)
\end{cases}
\]

Set equal:

\[
-\frac{4.5}{k} x = \frac{4.5}{k} (x - 9).
