- So \(g: [0,0.5] \to [0,?\]\).

Within this range,
\[
g(t) = |\,|t| - 0.25| = |t - 0.25| \quad \text{for } t \ge 0.
\]
Since \(t \in [0,0.5]\),
- \(g(t) = 0.25 - t\) for \(t \in [0,0.25]\),
- \(g(t) = t - 0.25\) for \(t \in [0.25,0.5]\).

