- On \([0,0.5]\), \(h(x)=4|0.25-x|\), which forms a "V" with minimum at \(x=0.25\), \(h(0.25)=0\).
- On \([0.5,1]\), \(h(x)=4|x-0.75|\), a "V" with minimum at \(x=0.75\), \(h(0.75)=0\).

