So,

\[
S = \frac{18}{68} - \frac{16}{68} + \frac{-1 + 5 \sqrt{185}}{68}
= \frac{18 - 16 - 1 + 5 \sqrt{185}}{68}
= \frac{1 + 5 \sqrt{185}}{68}.
\]

