\[
x_E^2 - 2 x_D x_E + x_D^2 + y_E^2 - 2 y_D y_E + y_D^2 = 169
\]

Note that \( x_E^2 + y_E^2 = 676 \).

So,

\[
676 - 2(x_D x_E + y_D y_E) + x_D^2 + y_D^2 = 169
